{:mulog/duration 239542, :mulog/namespace "ai.obney.grain.event-store-v3.core.in-memory", :grain/event-ids (#uuid "019e431b-4677-7042-b784-8f383e17b46e" #uuid "019e431b-466f-70d2-9522-7bce543cdfe3"), :mulog/outcome :ok, :mulog/parent-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YSixZfMEy2w76rV4A4JACriW8H08C", :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YSixZfMEy2w76rV4A4JACriW8H08C", :mulog/timestamp 1779242321528, :metric/name "GrainAppendEvents", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YSizvMZPLBle72nLBXuAWXfZIg53n", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.event-store-v3.core.in-memory/append}
{:mulog/duration 10240333, :mulog/namespace "ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core", :mulog/outcome :ok, :mulog/parent-trace nil, :ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core/command {:tick-id #uuid "1af87ea5-4ecb-4350-b116-7276b8f4d45f", :writes {:document-survey "### Structural Analysis of microFIT Contracts (v2.0 vs v3.1.1)\n\n#### **Standard Main Sections (Common to both Versions)**\n*   **Part 1 – Contract Details**\n    *   Section A: Contract and Supplier Information\n    *   Section B: Facility Characteristics\n    *   Section C: Documents Included; Defined Terms\n*   **Part 2 – General Terms and Conditions**\n    *   1. Term\n    *   2. Pricing Provisions and Payment\n    *   3. Environmental Attributes\n    *   4. Representations and Warranties\n    *   5. Covenants\n    *   6. General Conditions\n    *   7. Notices\n    *   8. Termination\n    *   9. Amendment\n    *   10. Assignment\n    *   11. Governing Law\n    *   12. Dispute Resolution\n    *   13. LDC Failure to Pay\n    *   14. Suppliers Composed of Multiple Entities\n*   **Appendices**\n    *   Appendix A – Definitions\n    *   Appendix B – Calculation of Indexed Contract Price\n    *   Appendix C – Solar PV Schedule\n    *   Appendix D-1 – Directly Connected Facility Schedule\n    *   Appendix D-2 – Indirectly Connected Facility Schedule\n    *   Appendix E – LDC Schedule (LDC Supplier Schedule)\n\n---\n\n#### **Structural Additions in v3.1.1**\n*   **Definitions:** Added the definition of **\"Prescribed Form\"** and **\"Website\"** in Appendix A.\n*   **Operational Clauses:** Multiple sections in Part 2 (Sections 5.1.2, 7.2, 8.1, and 9) were updated to require the use of the \"Prescribed Form\" for notifications, changes, or amendments.\n*   **Information Disclosure:** Under Section 6.5 (Collection of Information), a new provision was added allowing the OPA to disclose facility details to government ministries/agencies for the purpose of **promoting public health and safety** and emergency response planning.\n\n#### **Structural Removals in v3.1.1**\n*   **Appendix C Detail:** The extensive **\"Domestic Content Requirements\"** and the three associated **\"Domestic Content Grids\"** (Tables 1, 2, and 3) found in v2.0 were **removed** from Appendix C in v3.1.1. In v3.1.1, Appendix C only contains \"Additional Defined Terms.\"\n*   **Representations:** Section 4.4.4 of v2.0 (Representation regarding Domestic Content Level) was **removed** from v3.1.1.\n*   **Part 1 Section A:** Field (11) \"Minimum Required Domestic Content Level\" was **removed** from the Facility Characteristics section in v3.1.1."}, :command/name :sheet/complete-node-execution, :command/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T20:58:41.518017-05:00", :command/id #uuid "b4931d22-efe2-4f09-bc66-55e5c7652586", :duration-ms 5307, :usage {:prompt-tokens 25433, :completion-tokens 629, :total-tokens 26062}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "b53f4ee5-9cef-498b-be0e-0aed567bea70", :sheet-id #uuid "5241eb9d-a207-4d82-a629-77059bb1f90e"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YSixZfMEy2w76rV4A4JACriW8H08C", :mulog/timestamp 1779242321518, :metric/name "CommandProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YSixZfMEy2w76rV4A4JACriW8H08C", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core/process-command, :metric/resolution :high}
