.1, 2.1, and 2.2** regarding battery back-up and directly connected status are identical.\n*   **Appendix D-2, Sections 1 and 2** (Indirectly Connected Facility Schedule) including the \"In Parallel\" definition and the diagrams for battery back-up configurations are identical.\n*   **Appendix E, Sections 2.1, 2.2, 3.2, 3.3, 3.4, 3.5, and 3.6** are identical in substance and wording."}, :command/name :sheet/complete-node-execution, :command/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T20:59:10.940767-05:00", :command/id #uuid "cbb74b95-301f-4990-a583-da2f5005302c", :duration-ms 14606, :usage {:prompt-tokens 13857, :completion-tokens 2575, :total-tokens 16432}, :inputs {:ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-index 4, :ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors/map-each-parent #uuid "73703afb-6940-4721-8949-e096457d70f5"}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "0b2d09ee-1294-4a2f-a286-5b098b2f36e8", :sheet-id #uuid "5241eb9d-a207-4d82-a629-77059bb1f90e"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YURZVS6pQZF-eLcJejMAAgfHBwt5g", :mulog/timestamp 1779242350940, :metric/name "CommandProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YURZVS6pQZF-eLcJejMAAgfHBwt5g", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core/process-command, :metric/resolution :high}
