ent ministries, agencies, institutions or organizations, for purposes of promoting public health and safety and allowing emergency services personnel... to plan and respond properly in the event of an emergency.\"\n*   **6.7 Supplier Verification**:\n    *   **Addition**: Subsection 6.7 in V3 adds the sentence: \"OPA require verification of the identity of Supplier for the purposes of acknowledging agreement to amendments, assignments or any other matter relating to this Contract.\" (Note: grammatical error \"OPA require\" present in V3).\n\n**Section 7: Notices**\n*   **7.2 Change of Contact Information**: Wording change from \"by written notice to the other\" to \"by written notice **in the Prescribed Form** to the other.\"\n\n**Section 8: Termination**\n*   **8.1 On Notice**: Wording change from \"prior written notice to OPA\" to \"prior written notice **in the Prescribed Form** to OPA.\"\n\n**Section 9: Amendment**\n*   **Deletion/Wording Change**: V3 adds the requirement that the written agreement must be \"**in the Prescribed Form**.\"\n\n**Section 12: Dispute Resolution**\n*   **Addition**: V3 adds a substantial multi-paragraph section regarding \"Combined and Joined Disputes,\" allowing OPA to consolidate similar complaints or disputes from multiple suppliers for efficiency.\n*   **Minor Wording**: Added specific references to the \"Judicial District of Toronto Region,\" the \"City of Toronto,\" and explicit reference to the \"Arbitrations Act, 1991 (Ontario).\"\n\n**Identical Sections**\n*   5.2 Metering (5.2.1, 5.2.2)\n*   5.3 Eligibility (5.3.1)\n*   6.1 Access Rights\n*   6.2 Electricity\n*   6.3 Meter and Meter Data (6.3.1, 6.3.2)\n*   6.4 Freedom of Information\n*   6.6 Statement Copies\n*   7.1 Address for Notice\n*   7.3 Timing of Notice\n*   8.2 For Breach\n*   8.3 Automatic\n*   10 Assignment\n*   11 Governing Law"} {:raw_diffs "### 1. General Provisions & Dispute Resolution (Part 2, Sections 12-14)\n*   **Arbitration Appointment (Section 12):** Id