perty Identification Number`\n    *   `Renewable Biomass` (updated heat input percentages).\n    *   `Website`\n\n### 8. Appendix C, D, and E\n*   V3.1.1 includes highly specific schedules for **Solar PV (Appendix C)**, **Directly Connected (Appendix D-1)**, **Indirectly Connected (Appendix D-2)**, and **LDC Suppliers (Appendix E)**. While referenced in the V2 Table of Contents, the full text of these appendices in V3 includes specific battery configuration diagrams and legal replacements for the definition of \"Laws and Regulations\" for LDC-owned facilities.\n\n### Identical Sections\n*   Section **1 (Term)** is identical.\n*   Section **2.1 (Indexed Contract Price)** is identical.\n*   Section **3 (Environmental Attributes)** is identical in substance and wording." "### Comparison: Contract V2 Segment vs. Contract V3\n\n**Section 5: Covenants**\n*   **5.1.1**: The clause references are updated to reflect the new structure. V2 refers to \"B(2), B(3), B(6), B(7) and B(8)\"; V3 adds references to Part 1, Sections A(5), A(6), B(1).\n*   **5.1.2**: Wording change from \"notify OPA promptly of any change\" to \"notify OPA promptly **in the Prescribed Form** of any change.\"\n*   **5.1.3 & 5.1.4**: Identical.\n\n**Section 6: General Conditions**\n*   **6.5 Collection of Information**:\n    *   **Deletion**: The phrase \"information to establish compliance with Minimum Required Domestic Content Level\" has been removed, reflecting the elimination of domestic content requirements in V3.\n*   **6.5 Disclosure of Information**:\n    *   **Deletion**: The phrase \"compliance with Minimum Required Domestic Content Level\" has been removed.\n    *   **Addition**: OPA may now disclose information to \"other government ministries, agencies, institutions or organizations, for purposes of promoting public health and safety and allowing emergency services personnel... to plan and respond properly in the event of an emergency.\"\n*   **6.7 Supplier Verification**:\n    *   **Additio