\"Percentage Escalated\"**, **\"Prescribed Form\"**, and **\"Project Eligibility Requirements\"**. (Note: The V2 chunk cuts off at \"Distributi...\")." "The following specific changes were identified between the provided segment of Contract V2 (comprising the end of Appendix A, Appendix B, and the beginning of Appendix C) and the full Contract V3:\n\n### 1. Appendix A (Definitions)\n*   **Deemed Single Property**:\n    *   **V2**: Used standard list numbering (a), (b), (c), (d).\n    *   **V3**: Appends specific legal references to clause (b)(ii): \"Sections 50(3)(a), 50(3)(b), 50(3)(f), or 50(5)(a) of the **Planning Act (Ontario)**.\"\n*   **Existing Generation Facility**:\n    *   **V3 Addition**: New definition added: \"means an electricity generating facility that is located on the same property as the Facility and which is connected to the LDC distribution system.\"\n*   **Prescribed Form**:\n    *   **V3 Addition**: New definition added: \"means, in relation to a form, the latest version of the corresponding form appearing on the Website, as may be amended or replaced by the OPA from time to time and without notice to the Supplier.\"\n*   **Project Eligibility Requirements**:\n    *   **Clause (c)**: V3 adds \"unless otherwise consented to by the OPA in writing in its sole and absolute discretion.\"\n*   **Property Identification Number**:\n    *   **V2**: Referenced \"Land Titles Act R.S.O. 1990, c. L. 5, s. 141(2)\".\n    *   **V3**: Corrects/updates punctuation to \"Land Titles Act R.S.O. 1990, c. L. 5, s. 141(2).\" (identical text, verified).\n*   **Website**:\n    *   **V3 Addition**: New definition added identifying the microFIT URL.\n*   **Removed Definitions**: The definition for \"Minimum Required Domestic Content Level\" present in V2's Appendix A is **deleted** in V3's Appendix A.\n\n### 2. Appendix B (Calculation of Indexed Contract Price)\n*   **Mathematical Formula**:\n    *   **V2**: $\\text{CP}_y = \\text{CP} \\times [ (1 - \\text{PE}) + ( \\text{PE} \\times \\frac{\\text{CPI}_y}{\\text{CPI}_{\\text{BD}}} ) ]$\n    *   **V3**: Formula remains functionally identical but the visual rendering/typography in the V3 document uses a updated font style for the fraction $\\frac{\\text{CPI}_y}{\\text{CPI}_{\\text{BD}}}$.\n*   **Substantive Text**: The text in notes (a) and (b) and the variable definitions are **identical**.\n\n### 3. Appendix C (Solar Photovoltaic Schedule)\n*   **Definition of \"Existing Building\"**:\n    *   **V2**: Limited to buildings completely constructed on the date the Application was first submitted.\n    *   **V3**: Expanded to include a second clause: \"(b) in respect of which the OPA has, in its sole and absolute discretion, issued a written confirmation that the building will be deemed an Existing Building...\"\n*   **Domestic Content Requirements**:\n    *   **V2**: Included detailed sections 1.1 through 1.7 and two exhaustive \"Domestic Content Grids\" (Crystalline Silicon and Thin-Film) listing specific qualifying percentages for components like Silicon, Inverters, and Framing.\n    *   **V3**: **Entirely deleted** the Domestic Content Requirement sections (1.1-1.7) and the associated Tables 1 and 2 from Appendix C. Appendix C in V3 now only contains the definitions for \"Existing Building\" and \"Rooftop Facility.\"\n\n### 4. Structuring/Formatting\n*   **Page References**: V2's segment spans pages 14 through 18. The corresponding definitions and Appendix B/C in V3 are located on pages 12 through 18, reflecting the overall expansion of the contract (V3 includes more comprehensive schedules like Appendix D-1, D-2, and E)." "### 1. Deletions (Present in Chunk, Absent in V3)\n*   **Domestic Content Grids:** The domestic content requirements for Solar Photovoltaic Power Projects (referenced as Table 3 and associated qualifying percentages in the chunk) have been entirely removed. Contract V3 does not contain these tables or the specific \"Designated Activity\" manufacturing requirements for Ontario content.\n*   **Appendix E, Section 1 - \"Transmission System Code\" Definition:** The definition of \"Transmission System Code\" found in Appendix E of the chunk is deleted in the Appendix E of V3.\n\n### 2. Additions (Present in V3, Absent in Chunk)\n*   **Appendix C - Solar Photovoltaic Schedule:** The chunk contained manufacturing grids; however, V3 Appendix C is replaced with a new \"Solar Photovoltaic Schedule\" (V3 Page 18) that defines \"Existing Building\" and \"Rooftop Facility.\"\n\n### 3. Wording and Structural Changes\n*   **Appendix D-1 (Directly Connected Facility Schedule):**\n    *   **Section 1 heading:** Corrected from \"REPRESENTATIONS AND WARRANTES\" (chunk) to \"REPRESENTATIONS AND WARRANTIES\" (V3 Page 19).\n*   **Appendix E (LDC Supplier Schedule):**\n    *   **Section 1 (\"IESO\" Definition):** The chunk includes \"of Ontario established under Part II of the Electricity Act or its successor.\" V3 (Page 21) abbreviates this to \"established under Part II of the Electricity Act or its successor.\"\n    *   **Section 3.1(a):** Wording change from \"orders -in-council\" (chunk) to \"orders- in-council\" (V3 Page 21) regarding hyphenation.\n    *   **Section 3.1(b):** The word \"Person\" (capitalized in chunk) is changed to \"person\" (lowercase in V3 Page 21).\n\n### 4. Identical Sections\n*   **Appendix D-1, Sections 1.1, 2.1, and 2.2** regarding battery back-up and directly connected status are identical.\n*   **Appendix D-2, Sections 1 and 2** (Indirectly Connected Facility Schedule) including the \"In Parallel\" definition and the diagrams for battery back-up configurations are identical.\n*   **Appendix E, Sections 2.1, 2.2, 3.2, 3.3, 3.4, 3.5, and 3.6** are identical in substance and wording."]}}, :duration-ms 1, :event/tags #{[:tick #uuid "1af87ea5-4ecb-4350-b116-7276b8f4d45f"] [:sheet #uuid "5241eb9d-a207-4d82-a629-77059bb1f90e"] [:node #uuid "6bdb7abe-f22f-411e-8eb4-336252a4701b"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time