{:mulog/duration 7939250, :mulog/namespace "ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core", :mulog/outcome :ok, :mulog/parent-trace nil, :ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core/command {:tick-id #uuid "1af87ea5-4ecb-4350-b116-7276b8f4d45f", :writes {:section-diffs "### Part 1, Section B: Facility Characteristics\n- **Section B(5)(iv):** Entirely deleted the \"Minimum Required Domestic Content Level\" requirement of 60%.\n- **Section B(6):** Re-indexed following the deletion of B(5)(iv).\n\n### Part 2, Section 4: Representations and Warranties\n- **Section 4.4.4:** Deleted requirement for Solar PV facilities to meet Minimum Required Domestic Content Levels.\n- **Sections 4.4.5 - 4.4.6:** Re-numbered to 4.4.4 and 4.4.5 respectively.\n\n### Part 2, Section 5: Covenants\n- **Section 5.1.1:** Updated cross-references to Part 1. Now includes A(5), A(6), B(1), B(2), B(3), B(6), B(7), and B(8); specifically excludes B(4) and B(5).\n- **Section 5.1.2:** Added requirement to use the \"Prescribed Form\" for change notifications.\n- **Section 5.1.4:** Replaced broad solar requirements with a specific reference to Section B(5)(iii) (Rooftop vs. Non-Rooftop status).\n\n### Part 2, Section 6: General Conditions\n- **Section 6.5:** Massive expansion. Removed domestic content references. Added \"Collection of Information\" (GST numbers, third-party eligibility verification) and \"Disclosure of Information\" (sharing with Ministry of Energy and other ministries for public health/safety and emergency services including band councils).\n- **Section 6.5 (Consent):** Added a waiver of claims/defenses against the OPA/LDC/Government regarding information sharing.\n- **Section 6.7:** New section limiting the authority of a Supplier \"Representative\" regarding contract termination, amendment, or assignment.\n\n### Part 2, Section 7-9: Notices, Termination, and Amendments\n- **Sections 7.2, 8.1, and 9:** Added requirements that changes of contact info, termination notices, and written amendments must be submitted in the \"Prescribed Form.\"\n\n### Part 2, Section 12: Dispute Resolution\n- **Section 12:** Added a \"Combined and Joined Disputes\" clause allowing the OPA to consolidate multiple similar disputes. Updated legal venue to the Judicial District of Toronto Region and cited the Arbitrations Act, 1991.\n\n### Part 2, Section 14: Multiple Entities\n- **Section 14.2:** Updated internal cross-reference from \"14.1.1\" to \"14.1.\"\n\n### Appendix A: Definitions\n- **Deleted:** \"Domestic Content Level\" and \"Minimum Required Domestic Content Level.\"\n- **Added:** \"Existing Generation Facility,\" \"Prescribed Form,\" \"Website,\" \"LDC,\" \"microFIT Rules,\" and \"Project Eligibility Requirements.\"\n- **Updated:** \"Deemed Single Property\" (added Planning Act citations) and \"Nameplate Capacity\" (clarified Solar PV logic).\n\n### Appendix C: Solar Photovoltaic Schedule\n- **Sections 1.1 - 1.7:** Entirely deleted (Domestic Content Requirements and Grids).\n- **Definition of \"Existing Building\":** Expanded to include buildings confirmed by OPA discretion.", :major-changes "### MAJOR (Legal/Financial)\n*   **Removal of Domestic Content Requirements:** Significant policy shift affecting legal compliance and project eligibility (Sections B(5)(iv), 4.4.4, and Appendix C).\n*   **Information Disclosure & Waiver:** Suppliers now waive rights to claim against the OPA for sharing data with various government ministries and emergency services (Section 6.5).\n*   **Dispute Consolidation:** The OPA now has the legal right to join or consolidate disputes from different suppliers (Section 12).\n*   **Representative Limitations:** New legal restrictions on the power of a Supplier Representative to sign off on major contract changes (Section 6.7).\n*   **Joint and Several Liability Reference:** Correction of liability cross-references for multi-entity suppliers (Section 14).\n\n### MINOR (Clarification)\n*   **Prescribed Forms:** Mandatory use of OPA-standardized forms for notices, amendments, and terminations (Sections 5.1.2, 7.2, 8.1, 9).\n*   **Expanded Definitions:** Clarification of \"Existing Building\" and \"Nameplate Capacity\" to prevent ambiguity in solar project types (Appendix A & C).\n*   **Reference Updates:** Updating internal section pointers resulting from re-indexing and deletion of domestic content clauses (Sections 5.1.1, 5.1.4).\n\n### COSMETIC (Formatting)\n*   **Version Update:** Updated header and footer references to Version 3.1.1.\n*   **Re-indexing:** Sequential adjustment of section numbers following deletions (Sections 4.4, Part 1 Section B).\n*   **Typos/Punctuation:** Correction of \"REPRESENTATIONS AND WARRANTES\" to \"WARRANTIES\" and minor punctuation/capitalization adjustments (Appendix D-1, Appendix E)."}, :command/name :sheet/complete-node-execution, :command/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:00:13.268524-05:00", :command/id #uuid "aa811fcb-80f0-403b-a732-2410e24be4b3", :duration-ms 23911, :usage {:prompt-tokens 4386, :completion-tokens 5310, :total-tokens 9696}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "c02269d5-7d9c-4e42-abe7-4d80a5f08eca", :sheet-id #uuid "5241eb9d-a207-4d82-a629-77059bb1f90e"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YY3ki0hYPn0_bWxSo25z-X41Vc-W2", :mulog/timestamp 1779242413269, :metric/name "CommandProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YY3ki0hYPn0_bWxSo25z-X41Vc-W2", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core/process-command, :metric/resolution :high}
