 and Several Liability Reference:** Correction of liability cross-references for multi-entity suppliers (Section 14).\n\n### MINOR (Clarification)\n*   **Prescribed Forms:** Mandatory use of OPA-standardized forms for notices, amendments, and terminations (Sections 5.1.2, 7.2, 8.1, 9).\n*   **Expanded Definitions:** Clarification of \"Existing Building\" and \"Nameplate Capacity\" to prevent ambiguity in solar project types (Appendix A & C).\n*   **Reference Updates:** Updating internal section pointers resulting from re-indexing and deletion of domestic content clauses (Sections 5.1.1, 5.1.4).\n\n### COSMETIC (Formatting)\n*   **Version Update:** Updated header and footer references to Version 3.1.1.\n*   **Re-indexing:** Sequential adjustment of section numbers following deletions (Sections 4.4, Part 1 Section B).\n*   **Typos/Punctuation:** Correction of \"REPRESENTATIONS AND WARRANTES\" to \"WARRANTIES\" and minor punctuation/capitalization adjustments (Appendix D-1, Appendix E)."}, :node-id #uuid "77766312-1c24-4cfe-84aa-684732fa8e2a", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-started, :sheet-id #uuid "5241eb9d-a207-4d82-a629-77059bb1f90e", :event/id #uuid "019e431c-ace1-705f-8ee7-53254058799c"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YY3nrMKDhIlh4sxS42YBZ6dbq-iy4", :mulog/timestamp 1779242413282, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YY3nrMKDhIlh4sxS42YBZ6dbq-iy4", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
